  "@type": "Recipe",
  "name": "Salsa Verde",
  "text": "Salsa Verde\n\nPreparation time: 10 minutes\n\nCooking time: 30 minutes (to combine)\n\nYield: 2\n\nIngredients\n\n4 anchovy fillets,\n\n1 tbsp capers,\n\n1 clove garlic,\n\n1/2 lemon (zest and juice only),\n\n90ml olive oil,\n\n2 tbsp flat leaf parsley (chopped),\n\n1 tbsp basil (chopped),\n\nSalt & freshly ground black pepper.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Place the anchovy fillets, capers and garlic into a mortar and pestle and pound until broken down.\n\n2. Add the lemon zest and juice.\n\n3. Add the olive oil in a steady stream, whisking to combine.\n\n4. Stir in the parsley and basil then season with salt and pepper.",
  "prepTime": "PT10M",
